5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, and the journey audits on where minutes go. I want to see where the time is actually being lost.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. I suspect the headline figures may be masking some rather inconvenient long-term commitments.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. It is often in the echoes of the past that we find the clearest warnings.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I wish to understand the hidden approvals and the physical risks beneath the surface.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
